{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458480/extras/b06c02e074c76e1cc3d7717481f4d91a.avif?t=1752907969\" width=560 height=420 /></span><br><br>\u2606Summary\u2606</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a monster hunter who has bagged himself a vampire called Namel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But on his way home through the forest, he gets lost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the spell he used to capture Namel will only weaken the longer he stays lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to find a way out before the spell wears off!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2606Heroine\u2606</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458480/extras/9282a3014aec527641b8ba0dbfe09a30.avif?t=1752907969\" width=560 height=420 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2606Quick Tutorial\u2606</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing this game is a piece of cake. Just move your mouse cursor over to the available square you want to move the hunter to, and click on it to move him there.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458480/extras/057568c7f7462e3f621c72e1d452c1a4.avif?t=1752907969\" width=560 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different squares will trigger events with different effects, such as succubus encounters that will decrease Namel\u2019s bondage level, or the hunter eating food that will increase her bondage level. <br>You can also come across special pervy items to use on Namel!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458480/extras/49fbb2e6d0f4beded863ee86601d6faa.avif?t=1752907969\" width=560 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_parag